# Editing this file starts `source-probe-phase10.yml` on the branch it is pushed to.
#
# `workflow_dispatch` is unavailable until a workflow reaches the default branch, and the
# Phase-10 measurements have to be taken before the branch is mergeable — the adapters this
# phase ships must be written against a measured schema, not a remembered one (AGENTS.md
# section 3). This is the same request-file mechanism `.github/market-capture.request`
# already uses.
#
# Bump `run` to take a fresh set of measurements. Nothing is retained; the whole output is
# the job summary, which a human reads and then writes into `docs/DATA_SOURCES.md`.
run: 3
sources: fantasypros
requested_for: "Phase 10 — FFC / FantasyPros / Sleeper production dispositions"
